Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:17:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] coclaudex(03-prune): prune --older-than for old finished
 job directories

Dry run by default; --yes removes only finished jobs with no live process,
through an O_NOFOLLOW directory fd lock and rename-then-verify.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
